00:09:14,670 --> 00:09:16,660
and bad acoustics, I have talked about that

276
00:09:16,660 --> 00:09:19,239
on this stage in different phases.

277
00:09:19,239 --> 00:09:21,949
What would the world be like if we

278
00:09:21,949 --> 00:09:24,660
were speaking powerfully to people who are listening consciously

279
00:09:24,660 --> 00:09:27,739
in environments which were actually fit for

280
00:09:27,739 --> 00:09:30,819
purpose, or to make that a bit larger?

281
